      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kyle%2C_Texas",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Kyle’s original layout consisted of only six by three city blocks, including a combined train depot and cotton platform.",
